  title "Three Days"
  summary "Augur ☽'Silvsiaelrous~ discovers a mysterious warm tome called the Mist~Record in an unmapped tunnel beneath the ice, containing bioluminescent text that records everything that existed before the penguins. Three generations later, the Order uses the tome as a tool of control through the Mandatum∴ccord, a rule requiring all actions to be publicly witnessed and recorded, with each reader's fate documented by a notch carved into the spine. The tome's subsequent readers—Noctisum~, an unnamed reader during the Long Dark, and finally Totatirus~ Domina—either disappear, die, or become isolated keepers, unable to escape the knowledge the book imparts, leaving the artifact perpetually warm and waiting in its vault beneath the ice."
